# endpoint/featurizer directory.
#
# Submit from repo root:
#   bsub < experiments/admet_benchmark/lsf/job_02_qprofiler_array.sh
#
# Estimated wall time per job: ~2.5 h (QML on simulator, 10 models × 3 splits)
